---
args: {"promises": "PromiseEpisode[]", "sources": "EvidencePage[]"}
returns: "PromiseProgress[]"
---
For each promise match artifacts to the exact promised outcome and beneficiary. Compare actual delivery and any required acknowledgment or acceptance separately. An attachment or optimistic status update is not accepted delivery. Cancellation needs the authorized beneficiary or governing process. Partial delivery preserves the unresolved remaining scope. Return uncertain where identity, acceptance or cancellation authority is missing; do not close work just because the departure date passed.
